        "primary": {
          "eyebrow": "Player and ensemble",
          "title": "Built-in Virtual Orchestrion player",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The organ plays from a built-in Virtual Orchestrion player. It plays standard music written for this organ, and full orchestrations that run in sync with it.",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "start": 32,
                  "end": 51,
                  "type": "hyperlink",
                  "data": {
                    "link_type": "Web",
                    "url": "/virtual-orchestrion"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Connect other Decap instruments and the Bellow Organ can lead them as MIDI master, or follow them as slave. Add an Accordion Pedestal or a Percussion Unit and the street organ becomes a small band.",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "start": 115,
                  "end": 133,
